(182, 'In the review, what is indicated about Neptune\'s Voyage?', 'It is a major competitor of Titan Adventure.', 'It features an open-world format.', 'It is the first video game in a series.', 'It is Rimerko\'s most challenging game.', 'B', 'Bài đánh giá nêu: "Though open-world formats have been widespread in recent years, Neptune\'s Voyage brings something new to the format".', 7, 16),
(183, 'What can be concluded about Ms. Hanshu?', 'She wrote the script for Neptune\'s Voyage.', 'She successfully addressed Mr. Merson\'s concern.', 'She won an award for game design.', 'She is a project manager.', 'B', 'Merson lo lắng về việc hiển thị màu xanh lá và xanh dương, và bài review xác nhận phiên bản mới này đã sửa thành công lỗi đó: "This newest version also corrects the green and blue image rendering".', 7, 16),
(184, 'What does Mr. Weber find exciting about Neptune\'s Voyage?', 'It has players act in the role of Neptune.', 'It uses lighting to show players where to navigate.', 'It introduces a completely new set of characters.', 'It lets players explore new features without guidance.', 'D', 'Weber ấn tượng với: "By stripping down instructional guides, the game gives users the opportunity to discover new areas and devices" (khám phá không cần hướng dẫn).', 7, 16),
(185, 'When will Neptune\'s Voyage be available?', 'On September 4', 'On October 10', 'On April 1', 'On May 5', 'D', 'Câu kết bài đánh giá ghi rõ: "Neptune\'s Voyage launches May 5 on Rimerko Clutch and FS5".', 7, 16),
-- Đoạn 13 (186 - 190, group 17)
(186, 'According to the schedule, who is Ms. Jones?', 'The advertising manager at a radio station', 'The host of a community news program', 'The music director at Wonder Ridge Radio', 'The host of a sports radio program', 'C', 'Trong lịch phát sóng mục 7 P.M.-10 P.M.: "selected by our station\'s own music director | Host: Josie Jones".', 7, 17),
(187, 'What is the purpose of the e-mail?', 'To express praise for the radio station', 'To ask about job opportunities', 'To request more sports talk show programming', 'To inquire about the name of a song', 'A', 'Pierre Fabre viết thư để cảm ơn và khen ngợi đài phát thanh: "Thanks for this experience and for all your great programs. Your new fan...".', 7, 17),
(188, 'When did Mr. Fabre most likely first listen to Wonder Ridge Radio?', 'Between 6 A.M. and noon', 'Between noon and 4 P.M.', 'Between 4 P.M. and 7 P.M.', 'Between 7 P.M. and 10 P.M.', 'C', 'Ông nghe thấy "traditional music from France". Theo lịch, chương trình phát nhạc dân gian thế giới (Folk music from around the world) là FOLK FRENZY từ 4 P.M. đến 7 P.M.', 7, 17),
(189, 'What does the job advertisement suggest applicants must have?', 'A willingness to travel', 'Familiarity with computers', 'A degree in communications', 'Extensive experience in the radio industry', 'B', 'Mô tả công việc yêu cầu: "Updating the station\'s Web site... Using scheduling software...", đòi hỏi kỹ năng sử dụng máy tính thành thạo.', 7, 17),
(190, 'What radio program will probably receive the most support from the programming assistant?', 'Coffee Break', 'Afternoon Jazz', 'Folk Frenzy', 'Josie\'s Joint', 'A', 'Nhiệm vụ gồm "Conducting background research on interviewees... topics and guests for on-air interviews", phù hợp nhất với COFFEE BREAK (Local news and interviews with community members).', 7, 17),
-- Đoạn 14 (191 - 195, group 18)
(191, 'What do the instructions indicate about records requests?', 'They can be made only on certain days.', 'They can be made only online.', 'They can be filed only by authorized personnel.', 'They can be filed only after a fee is paid.', 'B', 'Mục 1 của hướng dẫn nêu rõ: "Currently, all requests must be made through the portal" (chỉ gửi yêu cầu qua cổng trực tuyến).', 7, 18),
(192, 'According to the e-mail, how does Mr. Brandenberg plan to use some public information?', 'To add information to a Web portal', 'To help his company advise the city', 'To identify an accounting error', 'To learn how an agency is structured', 'B', 'Brandenberg giải thích tài liệu này sẽ: "inform our firm\'s current work advising the city on wastewater management" (phục vụ việc tư vấn cho thành phố về xử lý nước thải).', 7, 18),
(193, 'What does the sign indicate visitors must do before entering a building?', 'Go through a security screening', 'Get a parking permit', 'Present some identification', 'Sign a logbook', 'D', 'Bảng chỉ dẫn ghi: "Visitors must sign in prior to entering this facility. Please enter your name and the room you will visit in the logbook" (ký vào sổ ghi danh).', 7, 18),
(194, 'What was Mr. Brandenberg expecting to receive?', 'An itemized statement of fees', 'A letter from his company', 'A phone call from a city official', 'A password for the Web portal', 'A', 'Theo mục 4 hướng dẫn, người yêu cầu sẽ nhận bảng kê chi tiết lệ phí ("itemized statement detailing the services..."). Brandenberg thắc mắc vì không nhận được lời giải thích nào cho khoản phí $300.', 7, 18),
(195, 'What room will Mr. Brandenberg most likely visit?', 'Room 100', 'Room 101', 'Room 102', 'Room 103', 'D', 'Brandenberg làm việc liên quan đến quản lý nước thải ("wastewater management"). Trong danh bạ tầng 1, phòng Wastewater là Room 103.', 7, 18),
-- Đoạn 15 (196 - 200, group 19)
(196, 'What does the review mention about Mr. Eklund?', 'He enjoys his work as a director.', 'He has been a mentor to many young people.', 'He is a well-known actor.', 'He has written many books.', 'C', 'Bài báo mô tả: "his storied career as an actor... captivating actor on stage and screen" (diễn viên nổi tiếng).', 7, 19),
(197, 'Where most likely will Ms. Joshi meet Mr. Eklund?', 'In Sweden', 'In France', 'In Italy', 'In the United Kingdom', 'A', 'Eklund sinh ra tại Thụy Điển ("his native Sweden"). Joshi viết rằng cô sẽ đến quê hương ông vào tháng tới ("visiting his home country next month") để phỏng vấn ông.', 7, 19),
(198, 'According to the first e-mail, what is one reason Ms. Joshi will travel in April?', 'To go on a vacation', 'To interview for a new job', 'To attend an international film festival', 'To speak at a conference', 'D', 'Joshi giải thích lý do chuyến đi: "address a journalists\' convention. I am the featured speaker" (phát biểu tại một hội nghị).', 7, 19),
(199, 'What is the purpose of the second e-mail?', 'To reserve a hotel room', 'To confirm meeting arrangements', 'To discuss an idea for a movie', 'To ask for transportation', 'B', 'Maria Cazalla gửi e-mail để: "finalize a few details with you. We have arranged transportation... Mr. Eklund would like you all to stay for lunch" (xác nhận lịch trình và sắp xếp buổi gặp).', 7, 19),
(200, 'What can be concluded about Mr. Eklund?', 'He hopes to write for a British news site.', 'He just hired a new assistant.', 'He was pleased with Ms. Joshi\'s review of his book.', 'He frequently cooks special meals.', 'C', 'E-mail thứ 2 cho biết: "He enjoys all your writing... and, of course, your recent article about The Theatre Lights Dimmed!" (ông ấy rất thích bài viết đánh giá của Joshi về cuốn sách).', 7, 19);

